== 1. db migrate --to @db on a database with no marker
$ prisma db migrate --to @db --db postgresql://postgres@localhost:54332/t1
│  migrations:  migrations
│  database:    postgresql://****@localhost:54332/t1
│  to:          @db

✔ Already up to date

App space
├─ (no operations)
└─ marker empty

→ Check every space against the database: prisma migration status
[exit 0]

