== 7. db migrate --show without a connection
$ prisma db migrate --show --config prisma.nodb.config.ts
✘ [CONFIG.DB_CONNECTION_REQUIRED] Database connection is required
  why: db migrate --show needs a database connection to read the live marker (or pass --from <contract> for an offline preview)
→ Run `prisma db migrate --show --from <contract>`, or set `db: { connection: "postgres://…" }` in prisma.config.ts
[exit 2]

