== 9. help text
│      --to <contract>       Target contract reference (hash, prefix, ref name, migration dir name, <dir>^, @contract, @db, or @empty)
│      --from <contract>     From-state for the --show preview (hash, prefix, ref name, migration dir name, <dir>^, @contract, @db, or @empty)
│    $ prisma db migrate --show --from @contract --to production
│  target contract. Requires a database connection. Pass --from for an
│      --from <contract>  Origin contract reference; same grammar as --to. With --from the path is computed offline, unless --from or --to is @db
│    $ prisma migration status --from abc123 --to production
